# Galactic Bridge MCP — configuration (all optional)

# Override the API base URL (defaults to the public bridge).
# GB_API_URL=https://galacticbridge.app

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: auto-signing (ADVANCED). Leave this UNSET for safe, read-only mode.
#
# Setting a private key turns on the `execute_bridge` tool, which signs and
# broadcasts real transactions. This moves funds irreversibly. Only enable it if
# you understand the risk, and never use a key that holds more than you can lose.
# Prefer a dedicated hot wallet.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GB_PRIVATE_KEY=0xyourPrivateKeyHere

# Optional RPC overrides used only by auto-signing (defaults are built in):
# GB_RPC_BSC=https://your-node/key
# GB_RPC_ARC=https://your-node/key
